WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
But you're in a different country.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:03.160
You can't do that.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.440
Both the immigration and their suicidal energy ideas

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.960
will be the death of Western Europe

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.280
if something is not done immediately.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:11.840
They cannot.

